<title>USA: Exide completes offer for debentures.</title>
<headline>Exide completes offer for debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exide Corp said Wednesday it completed an offer to purchase all of its outstanding 12-1/4 percent senior subordinated deferred coupon debentures due 2004. Payments will be made today.</p>
<p>Exide makes starting, lighting and ignition batteries and industrial batteries.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
